          "intro": [
            "TE326 has our patented ASA technology (Automatic Stroke Adjustment) as part of the percussion system. The high frequency and smooth operation of the ASA system extend the drifter’s service life, giving higher productivity and better profitability. Two power modes give precise control of the energy and frequency of the percussion system.",
